<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><Bill type="bill" xmlns="http://leg.wa.gov/2012/document"><BillHeading><RequestNumber>H-4063.1</RequestNumber><ShortBillId>HB 2808</ShortBillId><LongBillId>HOUSE BILL 2808</LongBillId><Legislature>66th Legislature</Legislature><Session>2020 Regular Session</Session><Sponsors>Representatives Walsh, Shea, Sutherland, Young, Van Werven, and Eslick</Sponsors><BillHistory><ReadDate>Read first time 01/22/20.</ReadDate><ReferredCommittee>Referred to Committee on Civil Rights &amp; Judiciary.</ReferredCommittee></BillHistory><BriefDescription>Ensuring the right of Washington residents to possess legal firearms.</BriefDescription></BillHeading>

<BillBody>
<BillTitle>AN ACT Relating to ensuring the right of Washington residents to possess legal firearms; and adding a new section to chapter 9.41 RCW.</BillTitle>
<EnactedClause />
<BillSection type="new" action="addsect" xmlns="http://leg.wa.gov/2012/document">
<BillSectionHeader><BillSectionNumber><TextRun>Sec. </TextRun><Value>1</Value><TextRun>.  </TextRun></BillSectionNumber>A new section is added to <ChapterCite><TextRun>chapter </TextRun><TitleNumber>9</TitleNumber><TextRun>.</TextRun><ChapterNumber>41</ChapterNumber><TextRun> RCW</TextRun></ChapterCite> to read as follows:</BillSectionHeader>
<P>All residents of the state who are legally entitled to possess firearms under state and federal law have the right to possess the following specifically identified firearms, as well as any other firearm that is permitted to be possessed under federal law:</P>
<P>(1) AK-47 in all forms;</P>
<P>(2) AK-74 in all forms;</P>
<P>(3) Algimec AGM-1 type semi-auto;</P>
<P>(4) American Arms Spectre da Semiautomatic carbine;</P>
<P>(5) AR15, M16, or M4 in all forms;</P>
<P>(6) AR 180 type semi-auto;</P>
<P>(7) Argentine L.S.R. semi-auto;</P>
<P>(8) Australian Automatic;</P>
<P>(9) Auto-Ordnance Thompson M1 and 1927 Semi-Automatics;</P>
<P>(10) Barrett .50 cal light semi-auto;</P>
<P>(11) Barrett .50 cal M87;</P>
<P>(12) Barrett .50 cal M107A1;</P>
<P>(13) Barrett REC7;</P>
<P>(14) Beretta AR70/S70 type semi-auto;</P>
<P>(15) Bushmaster Carbon 15;</P>
<P>(16) Bushmaster ACR;</P>
